| **Too much “do‑nothing” (action = 1) when a small push would be beneficial** | In the middle region (‑0.55 ≤ x < ‑0.2) we always choose action = 2 when velocity ≥ 0, even if the velocity is still very small. This wastes the opportunity to build a larger speed earlier, which later forces us to spend many steps coasting. |
