These rules keep the spirit of the previous best strategy but add two new refinements: (i) an explicit “wait‑at‑bottom” clause and (ii) a slightly higher “momentum‑building” threshold on the left side. Both should reduce the number of wasted oscillations and allow the car to reach the goal a few steps earlier.

