### 5️⃣ TL;DR – The new rule‑set  

*Use the true cosine‑based energy estimate, accelerate left until you have **more** than the energy needed to climb out, then on the right side accelerate right until you have **just enough** energy (with a tiny extra push), otherwise coast.*  

