| **Explicit braking (`action = 0`) when `v > v_needed + ε`** | Stops the car from overshooting the hill top, shaving a few extra steps off the episode length. |
| **Early right‑boost when deep in the left valley** | Gives the car the initial kinetic energy it needs to escape the bottom, avoiding the dead‑lock observed in strategies #1 and #2. |
| **Safety speed cap** (optional) | Guarantees we never waste steps by accelerating to absurd speeds that later need to be braked. |

