### 1️⃣ What the experiments taught us  

| Strategy | Typical episode length (≈ reward) | Did it reach the goal? | What worked / didn’t work |
|----------|-----------------------------------|------------------------|---------------------------|
| **Rule 1 + 2a/2b** (very simple “push left until –0.55, then coast”) | –200 (timeout) | **No** | The car never built enough kinetic energy to climb the right hill.  The left‑push was stopped too early (‑0.55 m) and the policy never tried to *re‑accelerate* once the velocity became positive. |
